{"id":"vod_lz_51370","vodId":"51370","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"潘朵拉之心","name_cn":"潘朵拉之心","date":"2009-01-01","year":"2009","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20230221-1/3dddc963be48cecc120020d2ffc0d525.jpg"},"summary":"　　世界被四大公爵家族所掌控着，奥兹（皆川纯子 配音）是萨流士家的下一任当家，然而，在十五岁成人仪式上，他却因为“存在”这种莫名其妙的理由被定罪，之后被投入了永远不得超生的阿鬼茨监狱之中。在监狱里，奥兹遇见了被称为“染血黑兔”的艾莉丝（小野大辅 配音），在艾莉丝的帮助之下，奥兹成功的逃出了监狱，并意外的回到了十年之前。　　重新获得自由之后，奥兹决定查明整个事件的真相，揪出想要抹杀他存在的幕后真凶。在此过程中，艾莉丝在奥兹的帮助之下亦试图寻回他失落的记忆。两人来到了传说中的禁忌之地，究竟有怎样的秘密隐藏在那里呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"动作,动画,奇幻"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-02-21 18:51:31","classic":true,"classicRank":47,"franchise":"潘朵拉之心","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230221/3710_00769a82/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230221/3711_ae0cfbe2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230221/3712_44e07494/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230221/3715_7ba35ddc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230221/3716_9eabeff9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230221/3717_d25d27d2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230221/3714_d219f7ff/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230221/3720_79d52267/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230221/3719_b837e9ba/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230221/3718_1e64edb5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230221/3724_5b5b4849/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230221/3721_7ce364c7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230221/3723_fe05a8f1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230221/3722_c973ec92/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15